@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #005A9C
skinparam ControlBorderColor #D32F2F
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor #388E3C
skinparam EntityBorderColor #F57C00

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "admin/users/index.blade.php" as UsersIndexView <<Boundary>>
control "UserController" as UserController <<Controller>>
entity "User" as UserEntity <<Entity>>

== View Data User ==

Actor -> UsersIndexView : Menekan menu "Pengguna" pada sidebar
activate UsersIndexView
UsersIndexView -> UserController : index(...)
activate UserController

UserController -> UserEntity : User::latest()->get(...)
activate UserEntity
UserEntity --> UserController : Daftar pengguna
deactivate UserEntity

UserController --> UsersIndexView : view('admin.users.index', data)
UsersIndexView --> Actor : Tampilkan Daftar Pengguna
deactivate UserController
deactivate UsersIndexView

== Create Data User ==

Actor -> UsersIndexView : Klik tombol "+ Tambah User"
activate UsersIndexView
UsersIndexView -> UsersIndexView : Set openCreate = true (Tampilkan modal tambah user)

Actor -> UsersIndexView : Mengisi username, email, password, role di form modal & klik "Simpan"
UsersIndexView -> UserController : store(request)
activate UserController

UserController -> UserController : validate(request)

UserController -> UserEntity : User::create(data)
activate UserEntity
UserEntity --> UserController : Berhasil menambahkan user
deactivate UserEntity

UserController --> UsersIndexView : redirect('/users') dengan status sukses
deactivate UserController
deactivate UsersIndexView

== Edit Data User ==

Actor -> UsersIndexView : Klik tombol "Edit" pada user tertentu
activate UsersIndexView
UsersIndexView -> UsersIndexView : Set openEdit = true (Tampilkan modal edit & isi data user)

Actor -> UsersIndexView : Mengubah data user di form modal & klik "Update"
UsersIndexView -> UserController : update(request, user)
activate UserController

UserController -> UserController : validate(request)

UserController -> UserEntity : $user->update(data)
activate UserEntity
UserEntity --> UserController : Berhasil memperbarui user
deactivate UserEntity

UserController --> UsersIndexView : redirect('/users') dengan status sukses
deactivate UserController
deactivate UsersIndexView

== Delete Data User ==

Actor -> UsersIndexView : Klik tombol "Hapus" pada user tertentu
activate UsersIndexView
UsersIndexView -> UsersIndexView : Set openDelete = true (Tampilkan modal konfirmasi hapus)

Actor -> UsersIndexView : Konfirmasi hapus dengan klik "Hapus" pada modal
UsersIndexView -> UserController : destroy(user)
activate UserController

UserController -> UserEntity : $user->delete(...)
activate UserEntity
UserEntity --> UserController : Berhasil menghapus user
deactivate UserEntity

UserController --> UsersIndexView : redirect('/users') dengan status sukses
deactivate UserController
deactivate UsersIndexView

@endum
